If constructing the bottle procedurally:
- Use sufficiently smooth geometry.
- Tune material properties carefully.
- Avoid primitive-looking low-poly shapes.
- Create a clean custom label texture.
- Use proper UV mapping or a reliable label-mapping method.

A realistic model with restrained movement is preferable to an elaborate but visibly fake model.

